---
// The "honest note" manifesto + footer nav. Present on every page.
import { TIP_URL, TIP_LABEL } from '../lib/site';
---
<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="honest">
      <span class="h-title">An honest note about how this is made ✷</span>
      Every poem here is written by a machine. That's not hidden — it's the point. This is a canon of
      slop: a project <b>about</b> the age of generated everything, made <b>from inside</b> it. But it's
      built to stay on the side of people: to catch the cruel line, to sit longer with the sad days.
      When the news is unbearable, the colour drains out, the words go quiet, and it tries again tomorrow.
    </div>
    <div class="foot-row">
      <span>Slop Canon · made by a machine, kept by a person</span>
      <span>
        <a href="/#todays-drop">Today</a> · <a href="/#archive">Archive</a> · <a href="/#shop">Shop</a> · <a href={TIP_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener" title={TIP_LABEL}>Tip</a>
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
